WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:07.150
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.980 --> 00:07.150
Just like the cruel angel

00:07.150 --> 00:15.110
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:07.150 --> 00:15.110
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.790
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.790 --> 00:26.000
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.790 --> 00:26.000
Even though the untested breeze...

00:26.000 --> 00:29.800
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:26.000 --> 00:29.800
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.800 --> 00:37.470
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.800 --> 00:37.550
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.550 --> 00:44.730
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.550 --> 00:44.730
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.730 --> 00:52.070
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.730 --> 00:52.070
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.070 --> 00:55.950
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.070 --> 00:55.950
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.950 --> 00:58.870
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.950 --> 00:58.870
...that upon your back

00:59.530 --> 01:03.160
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.530 --> 01:03.160
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:03.160 --> 01:06.830
no hane ga aru koto

01:03.160 --> 01:06.960
...towards the distant future

01:06.960 --> 01:10.960
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:07.000 --> 01:10.960
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.960 --> 01:14.630
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.960 --> 01:14.630
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.630 --> 01:18.470
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.630 --> 01:18.470
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.470 --> 01:21.970
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.470 --> 01:21.970
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.970 --> 01:25.730
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.970 --> 01:25.730
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.730 --> 01:29.770
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.730 --> 01:29.770
Young boy, become a legend

01:33.000 --> 01:35.310
Katsuragi, it's me.

01:35.310 --> 01:39.990
I've probably put you through a lot of trouble
by the time you're listening to this.

01:40.340 --> 01:41.830
I'm sorry.

01:41.830 --> 01:44.190
Tell Ritchan I said I'm sorry too.

01:44.190 --> 01:46.370
Also, since I've troubled you
so much anyway,

01:46.370 --> 01:48.520
there's this flower I've been growing...

01:48.520 --> 01:51.410
It'd make me happy if you'd water it for me.

01:51.410 --> 01:53.680
Shinji knows where it is.

01:53.680 --> 01:57.200
Katsuragi, the truth is with you.

01:57.200 --> 01:59.540
Go forward without any hesitation.

01:59.540 --> 02:02.590
If I ever get to see you again,

02:02.950 --> 02:05.680
I'll say the words I wasn't able
to say eight years ago.

02:06.080 --> 02:07.590
Bye.

02:10.000 --> 02:12.230
The phone that won't ring...

02:12.230 --> 02:14.190
Sorry,
but don't
bother me.
Working

02:16.030 --> 02:19.030
Miss Misato's still cooped up today.

02:19.030 --> 02:21.780
Do not enter without permission.
If you do,
I'll kill you!

02:24.260 --> 02:25.540
Asuka...

02:25.540 --> 02:27.860
I wonder if she won't be coming
back again today?

02:35.940 --> 02:39.710
She won't go to school and
she won't go back home.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.840
She just keeps playing games.

02:44.280 --> 02:45.430
Hikari?

02:45.430 --> 02:46.720
What is it?

02:46.720 --> 02:48.550
Wanna go to sleep?

02:48.550 --> 02:49.890
Okay...

03:06.800 --> 03:10.240
I'm sorry. Am I a bother?

03:10.240 --> 03:12.410
No, not at all.

03:16.060 --> 03:19.750
I wasn't able to win in my Eva.

03:19.750 --> 03:22.680
I'm not worth anything anymore.

03:22.680 --> 03:24.210
Not anywhere.

03:25.280 --> 03:29.060
I hate it. I hate it all. I hate everyone.

03:30.490 --> 03:33.390
But what I hate the most is myself.

03:33.830 --> 03:36.890
Somehow, I feel like nothing matters anymore.

03:37.500 --> 03:42.610
I think it's okay for you to do whatever
you want and I won't say anything,

03:42.610 --> 03:45.150
because I think you did your best, Asuka.

03:55.630 --> 03:58.890
I see, so she passed away.

03:58.890 --> 04:02.750
Yes, probably, even cats eventually
reach the end of their lives.

04:03.130 --> 04:05.440
Don't cry anymore, Grandma.

04:05.440 --> 04:08.810
I will. When I get some time,
I'll come home for a bit.

04:08.810 --> 04:11.720
I haven't visited Mother's grave
in three years either.

04:12.200 --> 04:14.390
I'll call you next time.

04:15.500 --> 04:17.680
Okay, I'm hanging up now.

04:18.330 --> 04:21.100
So, she died.

04:23.280 --> 04:25.280
EPISODE 23
TEARS

04:26.010 --> 04:30.410
It is impossible for us to recover
the Lance of Longinus.

04:30.410 --> 04:32.000
Why did you use it?

04:32.000 --> 04:35.870
We still do not have the planned number
of the Eva series.

04:35.870 --> 04:38.590
I made destroying the Angel my first priority.

04:38.590 --> 04:40.250
It was an unavoidable situation.

04:40.250 --> 04:42.130
Unavoidable, was it?

04:42.130 --> 04:45.300
You should make your excuses
more convincing than that.

04:45.300 --> 04:49.090
Your recent actions have become intolerable.

04:50.200 --> 04:52.800
Fuyutsuki, we're in the middle
of deliberations here.

04:54.370 --> 04:55.970
All right.

04:56.500 --> 04:58.820
An Angel is currently drawing near.

04:58.820 --> 05:00.570
Let us continue this at another time.

05:00.570 --> 05:03.600
If your seat is still waiting for you, that is.

05:04.630 --> 05:07.480
Ikari... Does he intend to betray Seele?

05:09.220 --> 05:11.160
I'll be there in fifteen minutes.

05:11.160 --> 05:15.200
Launch Unit 00 from Number 32.
Send Unit 02 as backup.

05:15.770 --> 05:18.580
That's right, Commander Ikari's orders
still stand for Unit 01.

05:18.580 --> 05:21.210
I don't have the authority to lift
the suspension on it.

05:21.210 --> 05:22.460
Bye.

05:24.610 --> 05:27.380
Visual confirmation of the Angel...

05:29.220 --> 05:32.060
Unit 00 launched, heading for intercept point.

05:32.660 --> 05:34.930
Unit 02 on standby at current location.

05:34.930 --> 05:36.440
No, launch her.

05:36.440 --> 05:37.520
Commander!

05:37.520 --> 05:40.440
It doesn't matter. She can at least
serve as a decoy.

05:40.440 --> 05:41.650
Yes, Sir.

05:41.650 --> 05:43.730
Eva Unit 02, prepare for launch.

05:44.170 --> 05:46.820
Here I am, shamelessly back in the pilot's seat.

05:46.820 --> 05:49.200
I'm so bad at letting things go.

05:49.200 --> 05:51.120
Unit 02, please go to Gate 8.

05:51.120 --> 05:53.950
Launch as soon as your deployment
position has been determined.

05:53.950 --> 05:57.860
I'll only be in the way, even if I go out there.

05:57.860 --> 06:01.290
Target approaching. It has crossed
the Gora Final Line of Defense.

06:01.290 --> 06:03.210
I don't care anymore.

06:11.530 --> 06:15.470
Target hovering over Ohwakudani,
continuing to rotate in place.

06:16.030 --> 06:18.430
Target's AT Field is still active.

06:19.000 --> 06:20.350
What were you doing?

06:20.350 --> 06:21.860
<i>L</i> won't waste time on excuses.

06:21.860 --> 06:22.980
What's the situation?

06:22.980 --> 06:25.150
We've been in a persistent deadlock.

06:25.150 --> 06:28.530
Pattern cycling from blue to orange!

06:28.530 --> 06:29.610
What does that mean?

06:29.610 --> 06:31.990
Magi indicates it cannot find a solution.

06:31.990 --> 06:34.740
We don't have enough data
to come to an answer.

06:34.740 --> 06:38.210
But one thing's certain.
That shape isn't a fixed form.

06:38.210 --> 06:40.670
So we can't make the first move.

06:41.140 --> 06:43.630
Rei, we're going to wait and watch for a while.

06:43.630 --> 06:45.040
No, it's coming.

06:48.980 --> 06:50.510
Rei, counter it!

06:50.510 --> 06:52.800
It's no use! She won't make it in time!

06:59.660 --> 07:02.650
Target is in physical contact with Unit 00!

07:02.650 --> 07:04.610
How is Unit 00's AT Field?!

07:04.610 --> 07:07.740
Operational, but the Angel is eroding it!

07:07.740 --> 07:11.200
The Angel is aggressively seeking
to make first contact?

07:11.200 --> 07:12.690
With Unit 00?

07:20.810 --> 07:22.120
Danger!

07:22.120 --> 07:24.670
It's invading Unit 00's organic pans!

07:24.670 --> 07:26.260
Launch Eva Unit 02!

07:26.260 --> 07:28.760
Send her to rescue and back up Rei!

07:32.360 --> 07:34.550
Target making further inroads!

07:34.550 --> 07:35.760
This is dangerous.

07:35.760 --> 07:38.920
Over five percent has been
biologically fused already.

07:43.910 --> 07:47.440
Asuka, close your distance by 300,
deploy your AT Field at maximum,

07:47.440 --> 07:49.650
and fire the Palette Gun into the target's rear!

07:49.650 --> 07:52.650
Got it? Eva Unit 02, lift off!

07:54.300 --> 07:57.830
Move out, Asuka. What's the matter?
What's wrong with Unit 02?!

07:57.830 --> 08:00.250
It's no good! The synch rate
is in the single digits!

08:00.250 --> 08:01.240
Asuka!

08:02.930 --> 08:06.040
It won't move. It just won't move!

08:06.600 --> 08:08.590
She'll only be a sitting duck out there!

08:08.590 --> 08:10.540
Bring her back! Quickly!

08:20.620 --> 08:21.600
Who's there?

08:21.600 --> 08:23.020
Me?

08:23.020 --> 08:25.230
The me inside the Eva.

08:25.710 --> 08:28.570
No, I can sense that there's
someone other than me.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.070
Who are you?

08:30.320 --> 08:33.850
An Angel? The person that we call an Angel?

08:34.630 --> 08:36.570
Won't you become one with me?

08:36.570 --> 08:40.320
No. I am me. I am not you.

08:40.930 --> 08:44.780
I see, but it's no use. It's too late now.

08:46.980 --> 08:50.150
I'll share what's in my heart with you.

08:50.150 --> 08:53.540
I'll share this feeling with you.

08:54.480 --> 08:59.300
Doesn't it hurt? See?
Doesn't your heart ache?

08:59.300 --> 09:02.220
Hun? No, you're wrong. It's...

09:03.490 --> 09:04.850
...loneliness?

09:04.850 --> 09:07.140
Yes, it's loneliness, isn't it?

09:07.140 --> 09:10.480
Loneliness? I don't understand.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.730
You hate being alone, don't you?

09:13.250 --> 09:17.910
There are so many of us, and yet,
you hate being alone.

09:17.910 --> 09:20.540
That is what loneliness is.

09:20.540 --> 09:23.220
That is what is inside your heart.

09:23.220 --> 09:27.320
That is your own heart, overflowing with sorrow.

09:29.810 --> 09:31.880
These are tears?

09:32.130 --> 09:34.500
The one crying is me?

09:36.340 --> 09:37.220
Rei!

09:37.220 --> 09:40.890
The suspension on Unit 01
has been lifted as of now.

09:40.890 --> 09:42.640
Send him out immediately.

09:42.990 --> 09:44.850
Send him out.

09:44.850 --> 09:46.220
Yes, Sir.

09:47.910 --> 09:51.820
What? You didn't send him out for me.

10:02.680 --> 10:05.620
Deploy your AT Field. Rescue Rei immediately.

10:05.620 --> 10:07.160
Okay!

10:08.170 --> 10:09.830
Ikari?

10:13.400 --> 10:17.540
This is my heart wanting to
become one with Ikari?

10:19.440 --> 10:20.710
No.

10:21.490 --> 10:23.060
The AT Field has been reversed!

10:23.060 --> 10:24.600
It will be eroded away at once!

10:24.600 --> 10:25.980
Does she intend to contain the Angel?!

10:26.230 --> 10:28.640
Rei, abandon the Eva and get out of there!

10:29.000 --> 10:30.150
No.

10:30.150 --> 10:33.800
If I go, the AT Field will disappear.

10:33.800 --> 10:35.680
So, I can't.

10:38.250 --> 10:39.920
Rei, do you mean to die?

10:39.920 --> 10:42.870
The core is collapsing!
Critical point exceeded!

11:10.580 --> 11:12.940
Target has been destroyed.

11:13.790 --> 11:17.100
At this time, this operation is officially over.

11:17.100 --> 11:19.820
Change our status to Class One Alert.

11:19.820 --> 11:22.820
Roger that. Switching immediately
to Condition Yellow.

11:22.820 --> 11:23.990
What about Unit 00's status?

11:23.990 --> 11:27.040
Ejection of the entry plug
has not been confirmed.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.620
Hurry the rescue operation for the survivor.

11:29.620 --> 11:31.320
If there is one, that is.

11:47.510 --> 11:50.350
No antibiotic substance from the 16th Angel
has been found thus far.

11:50.350 --> 11:52.390
We will continue searching.

11:50.810 --> 11:54.440
Level C traces are spreading towards the southwest.

11:53.310 --> 11:54.970
Dr. Akagi!

11:56.120 --> 11:58.360
What happened here will be
classified top secret.

11:58.360 --> 12:01.650
Take back the plug. Dispose of everything else.

12:01.650 --> 12:02.490
Roger that.

12:02.490 --> 12:04.690
Let's get to work! Quickly!

12:05.660 --> 12:05.910
{THE 3RD ANGEL

12:06.160 --> 12:06.410
{SACHIEL

12:06.160 --> 12:09.500
At last, we have defeated up through
the 16th Angel.

12:06.410 --> 12:06.660
{THE 4TH ANGEL

12:06.950 --> 12:07.200
{SHAMSHIEL

12:07.200 --> 12:07.450
{THE 5TH ANGEL

12:07.660 --> 12:07.910
{RAMIEL

12:07.910 --> 12:08.160
{THE 6TH ANGEL

12:08.410 --> 12:08.660
{GAGHIEL

12:08.660 --> 12:08.910
{THE 7TH ANGEL

12:09.160 --> 12:09.410
{ISRAFEL

12:09.410 --> 12:09.660
{THE 8TH ANGEL

12:09.500 --> 12:14.170
That leaves only one Angel described
in Seele's Dead Sea Scrolls.

12:09.910 --> 12:10.160
{SANDALPHON

12:10.160 --> 12:10.410
{THE 9TH ANGEL

12:10.660 --> 12:10.910
{MATRIEL

12:10.910 --> 12:11.160
{THE 10TH ANGEL

12:11.410 --> 12:11.660
{SAHAQIEL

12:11.660 --> 12:11.910
{THE 11TH ANGEL

12:12.160 --> 12:12.410
{YROUEL

12:12.410 --> 12:12.670
{THE 12TH ANGEL

12:12.920 --> 12:13.170
{LELIEL

12:13.170 --> 12:13.420
{THE 13TH ANGEL

12:13.670 --> 12:13.920
{BARADIEL

12:13.920 --> 12:14.170
{THE 14TH ANGEL

12:14.170 --> 12:16.460
The promised time is near.

12:14.420 --> 12:14.670
{ZERUEL

12:14.670 --> 12:14.920
{THE 15TH ANGEL

12:15.170 --> 12:15.420
{ARIEL

12:15.420 --> 12:15.670
{THE 16TH ANGEL

12:15.920 --> 12:16.170
{ARMISAEL

12:16.460 --> 12:20.460
Our journey has been long and the
sacrifices have been great.

12:20.460 --> 12:23.220
Indeed, first, the Lance of Longinus,

12:23.220 --> 12:25.340
and now, the loss of Unit 00.

12:25.340 --> 12:28.510
We have more than enough reasons
to relieve Ikari of his command.

12:28.510 --> 12:30.600
That man is smart enough
to know the significance

12:30.600 --> 12:32.520
of why we allowed Fuyutsuki to return safely.

12:32.520 --> 12:36.440
We need another human sacrifice
to counter Ikari.

12:36.440 --> 12:39.150
And we need someone who knows the truth.

13:01.360 --> 13:04.040
Shinji, I'm coming in.

13:11.620 --> 13:15.260
Miss Misato, the tears won't come.

13:15.790 --> 13:19.810
I feel sad, but the tears just won't come.

13:20.250 --> 13:26.560
Shinji, this is about all I can
do for you right now.

13:27.130 --> 13:28.910
Stop it!

13:28.910 --> 13:30.650
Stop it, Miss Misato.

13:31.300 --> 13:33.110
I'm sorry.

13:37.600 --> 13:39.680
But he must be feeling lonely.

13:39.680 --> 13:42.130
Is he afraid of women?

13:42.130 --> 13:44.880
No, he's afraid of being intimate with people.

13:46.150 --> 13:48.420
Pen Pen, come here.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.050
I see, it doesn't matter who.

13:55.050 --> 13:57.230
I am the one who is lonely.

14:07.340 --> 14:09.310
Yes, hello?

14:09.840 --> 14:11.450
What did you say?!

14:11.450 --> 14:12.580
Shinji!

14:12.580 --> 14:14.540
<i><i>Dr. Godai of Internal Medicine 1, Dr. Godai.</i></i>

14:15.660 --> 14:18.120
<i><i>Please contact Conference Room 2 immediately.</i></i>

14:18.960 --> 14:20.210
Ayanami!

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
Neurosurgery 1

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
Surgery 3

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
2nd Floor Ward

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
Diagnostic Radiology

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
X-ray Information Desk

14:25.090 --> 14:27.720
I'm so glad you're okay.

14:28.820 --> 14:31.390
I guess my dad's not here.

14:32.720 --> 14:35.020
Thank you for saving me.

14:35.020 --> 14:36.480
What do you mean?

14:36.480 --> 14:41.400
What do I mean? You sacrificed
Unit 00 to save me.

14:41.400 --> 14:44.020
I see, so I saved you.

14:44.020 --> 14:46.320
Yeah, you don't remember?

14:46.320 --> 14:48.150
No, I just don't know.

14:48.400 --> 14:51.620
Because I think I'm probably the third one.

14:53.930 --> 14:55.990
Ayanami

15:23.250 --> 15:25.230
These are tears?

15:25.230 --> 15:26.860
This should be the first time I've seen them,

15:26.860 --> 15:29.100
but I feel like this isn't the first time.

15:29.670 --> 15:31.530
Am I crying?

15:32.420 --> 15:35.290
Why am I crying?

15:35.290 --> 15:38.830
That's right. The First Child will be
maintained in her current condition.

15:38.830 --> 15:41.040
There is no need for new restrictions.

15:41.040 --> 15:43.500
The same goes for the Second and the Third.

15:43.500 --> 15:45.290
They only need to be watched.

15:45.290 --> 15:50.130
But Chairman Kiel and the rest will raise
a fuss when they learn that Rei is alive.

15:50.130 --> 15:53.590
I have offered something else
to Seele's old men.

15:53.590 --> 15:55.210
We needn't worry.

15:56.390 --> 15:59.430
We would like for things to proceed smoothly.

15:59.430 --> 16:03.980
We do not wish to subject you to
any more degradation and suffering.

16:03.980 --> 16:06.520
I do not feel humiliated whatsoever.

16:06.520 --> 16:08.650
A strong-willed woman.

16:08.650 --> 16:11.280
I can understand why Ikari
would want you by his side.

16:11.280 --> 16:16.990
But the person who handed you to us
is none other than Ikari.

16:17.240 --> 16:19.910
He refused to hand over the pilot
of Unit 00 for questioning.

16:19.910 --> 16:23.210
He sent you as a substitute, Dr. Akagi.

16:23.850 --> 16:26.460
I was sent in place of Rei?

16:26.710 --> 16:28.340
Sorry,
but don't
bother me.
Working

16:28.730 --> 16:31.460
This is a part of the truth that you wanted.

16:31.760 --> 16:35.050
I devised thirty-six other ways
to send it to you,

16:35.050 --> 16:36.680
but you probably won't get them.

16:36.680 --> 16:38.760
The only definite one is this capsule.

16:39.490 --> 16:41.350
This is everything I have to offer.

16:41.350 --> 16:43.300
Do with it as you see fit.

16:43.300 --> 16:46.890
The password is our very first
memory together.

16:47.460 --> 16:49.560
Bye, take care.

16:50.880 --> 16:54.900
The phone that won't ring,
I won't let it irritate me anymore.

16:56.950 --> 16:59.870
Because I've accepted your feelings.

17:03.620 --> 17:06.710
Are we certain we did the right thing
concerning Dr. Akagi?

17:06.710 --> 17:08.420
She is different from Fuyutsuki.

17:08.420 --> 17:10.670
Returning her is in our best interest.

17:10.670 --> 17:12.920
She has rendered distinguishing service
to the Eva series.

17:12.920 --> 17:15.050
She can be of some use to us right now.

17:15.050 --> 17:18.350
Indeed, for the sake of mankind's future.

17:18.350 --> 17:22.060
Eight Evangelions are already being prepared.

17:22.060 --> 17:24.730
Which leaves four more.

17:24.730 --> 17:29.790
The annihilation of New Tokyo-S will be good
material upon which to advance our plans.

17:29.790 --> 17:31.400
Hurry their completion.

17:31.400 --> 17:33.860
That will be our promised day.

17:38.090 --> 17:39.830
Yes, hello?

17:40.180 --> 17:41.830
Just listen to me.

17:41.830 --> 17:43.620
I've released the restraints placed on you.

17:43.620 --> 17:45.540
You should be able to go outside now.

17:45.540 --> 17:46.990
Miss Ritsuko?

17:58.440 --> 18:00.960
It's no use, not without my pass.

18:01.470 --> 18:04.310
I see. It's Kaji's handiwork, isn't it?

18:04.310 --> 18:07.190
You're going to let me see the secret
in there with my own eyes.

18:07.350 --> 18:09.980
Fine, but he's coming too.

18:12.580 --> 18:13.690
Fine.

18:32.350 --> 18:34.670
This looks just like Ayanami's room.

18:34.670 --> 18:36.550
This IS Rei Ayanami's room.

18:36.550 --> 18:38.550
This is where she was born and raised.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.550
This place?

18:39.550 --> 18:41.780
Yes, this is where she was born.

18:41.780 --> 18:44.770
The water and light that form
Rei's subconscious

18:44.770 --> 18:46.930
must have a strong impression of this place.

18:46.930 --> 18:51.020
Dr. Akagi, this isn't what I came here to see.

18:51.020 --> 18:53.270
I know, Misato.

18:56.420 --> 18:57.690
Evas?!

18:57.690 --> 18:59.150
The very first ones.

18:59.150 --> 19:00.490
They are the failures.

19:00.490 --> 19:02.440
They were scrapped ten years ago.

19:02.800 --> 19:04.580
A graveyard for Evas...

19:04.580 --> 19:06.540
It's just a garbage dump.

19:06.540 --> 19:09.110
This is also where your mother disappeared.

19:09.430 --> 19:13.670
You may not remember it, but I believe
you were also watching

19:13.670 --> 19:16.090
the very moment your mother vanished.

19:18.470 --> 19:19.790
Ritsuko!

19:27.280 --> 19:30.310
So, this is the source of the dummy plugs?

19:30.310 --> 19:32.190
I will show you the truth.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.600
Rei Ayanami?

19:42.420 --> 19:45.240
You're not saying the Evas' dummy plugs are...

19:45.240 --> 19:48.200
That's right, the part that becomes
the core of the dummy system,

19:48.200 --> 19:49.870
and this is the manufacturing plant for it.

19:49.870 --> 19:51.210
This is?!

19:51.210 --> 19:52.960
These are just dummies.

19:52.960 --> 19:55.620
And nothing more than pans for Rei.

19:56.060 --> 19:59.840
Man found God and in their joy,
tried to make Him theirs.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.630
That's why there was divine retribution.

20:01.630 --> 20:03.550
That was fifteen years ago.

20:03.550 --> 20:06.340
The God they found had also
disappeared by then.

20:06.340 --> 20:10.150
But then, they tried to resurrect
God on their own.

20:10.150 --> 20:11.600
The result was Adam.

20:11.850 --> 20:15.190
And imitating God, they created
people from Adam.

20:15.190 --> 20:16.730
The result was the Evas.

20:16.730 --> 20:19.690
People? They're human?

20:19.690 --> 20:22.030
Yes, they're human.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.660
The Evas do not intrinsically have souls,

20:23.660 --> 20:26.040
but they have human souls embedded in them.

20:26.040 --> 20:28.230
They were all salvaged.

20:28.550 --> 20:31.910
The only vessel that contained a soul was Rei.

20:31.910 --> 20:34.740
She was the only one born with a soul.

20:34.740 --> 20:37.250
The Chamber of Gaf was empty, you see.

20:37.250 --> 20:40.550
These things here that look like Rei
have no souls.

20:40.550 --> 20:42.190
They're just vessels.

20:42.190 --> 20:44.800
That's why I'm going to destroy them.
Because I hate them.

20:53.200 --> 20:55.970
Do you know just what you're doing?!

20:57.210 --> 21:00.280
Yes, I know. I'm destroying them.

21:00.280 --> 21:03.650
They're not people.
They're things shaped like people.

21:04.050 --> 21:08.030
But I lost, even to these things! I couldn't win!

21:08.030 --> 21:10.160
I only needed to think of him,

21:10.160 --> 21:13.090
and I could endure any kind of humiliation!

21:13.090 --> 21:15.630
I didn't care what happened to my body!

21:15.630 --> 21:19.490
But he... He...

21:20.060 --> 21:21.790
And I knew too.

21:22.210 --> 21:24.500
I'm a fool!

21:24.940 --> 21:27.880
Like mother, like daughter,
we're both big fools!

21:30.030 --> 21:32.720
If you want to kill me, do it.

21:32.720 --> 21:35.470
No, I would be happy if you would do it.

21:36.120 --> 21:39.010
That would be truly foolish of you.

21:48.340 --> 21:51.610
The tragedy of the people
possessed by the Evas...

21:56.210 --> 21:58.210
But that goes for me too.

21:58.250 --> 22:00.630
TO BE CONTINUED

23:06.070 --> 23:06.900
PREVIEW

23:06.820 --> 23:08.490
The city disappears, his friends leave.

23:08.490 --> 23:10.950
A boy smiles upon the timid Shinji.

23:10.950 --> 23:14.330
Shinji gives himself over to the smile
that is like a soothing breeze.

23:14.330 --> 23:17.700
But a cruel fate was in store for them.

23:17.700 --> 23:19.710
Next time: "The Final Messenger"

23:18.710 --> 23:21.080
The Final Messenger
